DriveEncoderOutputConfigureInput(Y,0,0)
DriveEncoderOutputConfigureDivider(X,0,1)
DriveEncoderOutputConfigureDivider(Y,0,1)
DriveEncoderOutputOn(X,0,0)
DriveEncoderOutputOn(Y,0,0)


